{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgmxLuBUZ8jgfTm7Q9PUy","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I'm stopping here. This is my seventh screen, I'm tired, and the minus signs at the bottom worry me.\n\n**What I'd tell my son:**\n\n\"Look, I didn't decide anything, and I wouldn't put money in on the strength of this page. You'll need to sit with me, or I'll ask at the bank.\n\nIt's a dark screen full of English letters, but it did seem to answer the question. The page has its own example: 10,000 ₪ now, then 500 ₪ a month for 10 years. That's 70,000 ₪ put in. For that it says the cheapest choice leaves **86,045 ₪** after 10 years, 'אחרי דמי ניהול ומס, בכסף של היום'. The cheapest place to hold it is **פסגות** (פסגות ניירות ערך בע\"מ). The fund is **אי.בי.אי. מחקה (4A) ת\"א 125**, number 5112628. My bank, whichever line it is, comes out a few thousand lower. לאומי, for example, is 82,968, and מזרחי is 77,294.\n\nBut that 86,045 is built on a '7%' a year in a box, and the page only says 'לדוגמה של האתר'. I don't know whether that's a promise. Then right under the chosen fund it says '−0.04%' 'בשנה · שנה אחת'. Did it lose money? That frightened me, just like the fund years ago. I also don't know these companies, פסגות or אי.בי.אי. They aren't my bank.\"\n\n**What I looked at:**\n1. The title, 'איפה ואיך הכי זול להשקיע במדד'. Here מדד means something other than the price index on the news, I think.\n2. The 'ת\"א-125' button, already chosen.\n3. The boxes: 10,000 now, 500 a month, 7%. I didn't touch the sliders.\n4. The big box with 70,000 and 86,045, and next to it 85,015.\n5. The costs: 'הקרן 1,390 ₪ פחות'.\n6. The list of banks, and the fund box.\n\n**What I skipped:** the little colour bars, the 'לא בחישוב' notes about soldiers and students, the folds with the little arrows, and everything after the start of 'כל הקרנות על מדד ת\"א-125'.\n\n**What I didn't understand:** ETF-type letters like MSCI and S&P, 'קרן מחקה', 'נאמן 0.025%', 'דמי משמרת', 'העמלות זו על זו', 'תכלית סל', 'מחזיקה את המניות' and 'כמה דרכים יחד'. I also don't know what the purple dotted lines under the numbers mean. The four colours in the bars are too alike for me to tell apart, and the grey text on black is hard to read.\n\n**Where I got tired or worried:** the long list of banks, and then the minus signs: '−0.04%', '−1,030 ₪' and '−1,342'."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3680,"cache_read_input_tokens":13425,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3680},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0ef9124e-e96c-42d5-95c6-e644143068c2","uuid":"85600815-4cab-4440-a389-e5d405c9bc48","timestamp":"2026-11-06T16:01:57.137Z","request_id":"req_011CgmxLtts6APZDfMXHdC3L"}
